{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:303:439:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/301/dialogueEntries/114/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/301/dialogueEntries/114/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]I dig the commentary! And good to see you’re an advocate of the chill life!", "context": {"actorId": "14", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 439, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 441]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "a813cee9317ed59d00f7858e18a8ec2cdceba822c6c74bad8142ed80221a213a", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]از این نگاه انتقادیت خوشم اومد! خوشحالم که طرفدار زندگیِ آروم هم هستی!", "targetSha256": "977ea8ebb012cfee97d991a3b2a7d6704fb0f87b4b6d2e6ee9db92c9ca05fda7"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:303:441:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/301/dialogueEntries/116/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/301/dialogueEntries/116/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]Yo, wait, are WE the bugs?? Damn.", "context": {"actorId": "13", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 441, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 443]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "1fe3f1c7af0e366d82de840001cb12c904c443e482ad373dd42a040b236d96d9", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]هی، صبر کن، یعنی خودِ ما حشره‌ایم؟! لعنتی.", "targetSha256": "f52a8b8e40f9dc5063e1c027af3ce6c8302ecebb85f8481476223931508b0904"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:382:527:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/380/dialogueEntries/21/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/380/dialogueEntries/21/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]See, I was pretty tired from the evening already, and a bit of alcohol always gets me nice and sleepy.", "context": {"actorId": "3", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/botbMabel/03_BuckyStory", "conversationId": 382, "entryId": 527, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[382, 528]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "2e6f231658acb860bd9c07605c24e7e9d23fec99f458555c801d952ad7d2a387", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]ببین، از فعالیت‌های اون شب حسابی خسته بودم؛ یه کم الکل هم همیشه خوب خواب‌آلودم می‌کنه.", "targetSha256": "ffa786a6840894d995b4d6f8a6880f6bb73263c22e8ffc801e074ada92e1432d"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:448:739:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/447/dialogueEntries/8/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/447/dialogueEntries/8/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Have you ever had one of those days where like, you’re just more horny than usual?", "context": {"actorId": "19", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/rascalSoloKnotStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 448, "entryId": 739, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[448, 740]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "eb7dcc77d8970247cc23c769f3a4421992d223a7e3d34986d10a3509c6d1c50d", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "تا حالا از اون روزها داشتی که مثلاً، بیشتر از معمول شهوتران باشی؟", "targetSha256": "b5dde6b94cffb8a51ac96be5f3bb7c21de912c9e611d5862f59566bf75f0733f"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:448:747:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/447/dialogueEntries/16/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/447/dialogueEntries/16/fields/6/value"}], "source": "And SOMETIMES you’re like - dang… this feels bigger than usual…", "context": {"actorId": "19", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/rascalSoloKnotStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 448, "entryId": 747, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[448, 748]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "d5206c2c92629535949422b9ef01c6cbd9d3f29785172f2a287ba51d61d228c5", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "گاهی هم می‌گی: لعنتی… انگار از معمول بزرگ‌تره…", "targetSha256": "1d1caa0b869cbbd1399918ece3a729c5068f56d7105f562c77549af77ac86528"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:449:753:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/448/dialogueEntries/22/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/448/dialogueEntries/22/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Oh gosh, the orgasm is great too. Pulse after pulse, clenching down hard on my claws!", "context": {"actorId": "19", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/rascalSoloAnalStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 449, "entryId": 753, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[449, 754]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "1554e86abef642a6a7aa9722e8ec5179d29fc65359e1eebf3cea3609af85c73d", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "وای، ارگاسمش هم عالیه. با هر تپش، دیواره‌ها محکم دور چنگال‌هام جمع می‌شن!", "targetSha256": "60fe69cc2c01db05e4d1f77b7c49e529c547d79e4824ca75b183cd1e3001b31d"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:453:842:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/452/dialogueEntries/194/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/452/dialogueEntries/194/fields/6/value"}], "source": "All squeaky clean down there!", "context": {"actorId": "20", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/melodyExcursionsStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 453, "entryId": 842, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[453, 844]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "d10253d848274b0cb4130b5c504f8a9b904b8473ee0279abf6b52f116c86449e", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "اون پایین از تمیزی جیرجیر می‌کنه!", "targetSha256": "6ecab558af5bacb8be089d89c057b015971136bc2811ea3dc1957b637163b87d"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:453:844:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/452/dialogueEntries/196/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/452/dialogueEntries/196/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Yes darling, someone certainly was squeaking, that’s for sure…", "context": {"actorId": "25", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/melodyExcursionsStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 453, "entryId": 844, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[453, 845]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "8249971ba3ee82f6723e6d7afc2bf29f344ba79b7455897125128c9b62b43211", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "بله عزیزم، قطعاً یکی حسابی جیرجیر می‌کرد، این که حتمیه…", "targetSha256": "d637806afb875fd52360819ce7914fe7a1c3db8df6965539b198f0138f6daca9"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:483:756:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/512/dialogueEntries/22/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/512/dialogueEntries/22/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=3]But that one seemed a bit worse than usual…", "context": {"actorId": "3", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/afterTheStorm/02_bucky", "conversationId": 483, "entryId": 756, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[483, 759]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "84c3257f8dff42fad5ad013124874a1ad97ca109de31ebca3d2375026124a31c", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=3]ولی اون یکی یه کم بدتر از معمول به نظر می‌رسید…", "targetSha256": "c8c9b41fafc88efe05e2c680c2adcdce59681b5a7fb3073c31bb256c8332a5a1"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:490:774:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/519/dialogueEntries/30/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/519/dialogueEntries/30/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=4]Actually, I was gonna ask you Mabel. Do your folks have anything to say about all of this?", "context": {"actorId": "9", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/afterTheStorm/00_augustus", "conversationId": 490, "entryId": 774, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[490, 775]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "3856ce696eba326b7f4a74a9f1dd591fc4230cd839fb87c897880eda526a7e5a", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=4]راستش می‌خواستم از تو بپرسم میبل. مردمت دربارهٔ این‌همه اتفاق چیزی گفته‌اند؟", "targetSha256": "1ab4dca745eb555ba972845f836796cff5955cd3f219f0d19f7027edf675945a"}
