{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:492:802:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/521/dialogueEntries/56/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/521/dialogueEntries/56/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=5]So they spend a lot of their time doing rituals to \"appease\" this spirit.", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/fireflies/02_collectingFireflies", "conversationId": 492, "entryId": 802, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[492, 803]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "b524db1f2a9d1bfbc28ebed6029a89c247f04b1a89aa9c49642a817ef7b1fcc6", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=5]برای همین وقت زیادی رو صرف مراسمی برای «راضی نگه داشتنِ» این روح می‌کنن.", "targetSha256": "cc72ef004ac984772af57e925cae1095dcb53001e062aac01f5efd0a32229127"}
